{"id":"n14757-1-7","stage":2,"title":"독감 · 流感","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14757-1-7-1","ko":"열이 나고 기침과 가래가 심해요.","zh":"我发烧了，咳嗽和痰也很严重。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"열이","meaning":"热，烧","explanation":"열：热，烧；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"열","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67807","senseId":"1","lemma":"열","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나고","meaning":"发，闹","explanation":"나다：发，闹；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"20","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기침과","meaning":"咳嗽","explanation":"기침：咳嗽；과：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"기침","audio":"/audio/aa2351b107c957346a08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38465","senseId":"1","lemma":"기침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가래가","meaning":"痰","explanation":"가래：痰；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가래","audio":"/audio/63970fdabb42bf19caef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:가래:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"가래","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"심해요.","meaning":"严重","explanation":"심하다：严重；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"심하다","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65046","senseId":"1","lemma":"심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f4112362e973dd6","term":"열","zh":"热，烧","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3","entryId":"67807","definition":"生病是在体内产生的热气。","pronunciation":["열"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发，闹","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"身体上产生某种现象或生病。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"aa2351b107c95734","term":"기침","zh":"咳嗽","audio":"/audio/aa2351b107c957346a08.mp3","entryId":"38465","definition":"空气从肺部通过喉咙突然喷出来，同时发出粗声。","pronunciation":["기침"]},{"id":"63970fdabb42bf19","term":"가래","zh":"痰","audio":"/audio/63970fdabb42bf19caef.mp3","definition":"呼吸道内分泌、可经咳嗽排出的黏液；本课按呼吸道症状语境补充。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"a1212e5a4cc18554","term":"심하다","zh":"严重","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3","entryId":"65046","definition":"程度过头。","pronunciation":["심ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c2c0b0b1e86c24579ee4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14757-1-7-2","ko":"독감이 든 것 같군요.","zh":"看来是得了流感呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"독감이","meaning":"流感","explanation":"독감：流感；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"독감","audio":"/audio/f174359c9d8c2ad219d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14757","senseId":"1","lemma":"독감","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"든","meaning":"患，生，得","explanation":"들다：患，生，得；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"21","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같군요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f174359c9d8c2ad2","term":"독감","zh":"流感","audio":"/audio/f174359c9d8c2ad219d7.mp3","entryId":"14757","definition":"非常严重的流行性感冒。","pronunciation":["독깜"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"患，生，得","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"身体出现病症。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","defini